[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on a lift\nand raise it.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752825\">4450B02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Or:</p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nuts securing the anchorage rod.</p><p>2. Remove the anchorage rod at the end of the anti-roll bar.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046752.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the anti-roll bar anchorage\nrod.</p><p>Tighten the anchorage rod fixing nuts to\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT ANTI-ROLL BAR. ANCHORAGE ROD.</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.3</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2752825\">4450B02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Or:</p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Lower the left and remove the vehicle.</p>"]]